    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d239">

                <pb facs="0602" n="580" xml:id="pg580"/>

                <head>239. Letter From the Ambassador at Large (Harriman) to the President<anchor
                        n="1" xml:id="d239-f1"/></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                ><placeName>Washington</placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                                when="1961-11-12">November 12, 1961</date>.</hi></dateline></opener>
                <p>Mr. President: I have given a copy of this draft memorandum to Dean Rusk. He
                    asked me to tell you his comment. “It is a matter of timing” bearing in mind
                    “other communications” on the same subject.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#bold">Averell</hi></signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d239-a1.xml" xpointer="d239-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
